   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Police assistance I</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Polisinsats I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att f&#xe5; en bra grupp polisinstrukt&#xf6;rer som sj&#xe4;lv- st&#xe4;ndigt och fortl&#xf6;pande utbildar lokala poliser och aspiranter i m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter, etik, moral och konfliktl&#xf6;sning. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r attf&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra utbildningsf&#xf6;rm&#xe5;gan p&#xe5; polisakademin i Sarajevo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will assist Bosnia-Hercigovina in creating a modern, professional, impartial police service exercising a high standard of ethical conduct in the performance of their duties. More specifically,the project aims at improving the training capacity at the Police Academy in Sarajevo.</narrative>
  </description>
